{"id":"7f70f0a586c01e83","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-analysis2-bounded-variation-function.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Bounded Variation Function","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-bounded-variation-function — ZFC Analysis2 Bounded Variation Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-bounded-variation-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-bounded-variation-function"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-bounded-variation-function — ZFC Analysis2 Bounded Variation Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-bounded-variation-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-bounded-variation-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-bounded-variation-function — ZFC Analysis2 Bounded Variation Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a\\leq b\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a\\leq b\\)</span> (interval endpoints)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,[a,b],\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,[a,b],\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (real-valued function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2BoundedVariationFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2BoundedVariationFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}variation\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2BoundedVariationFunction}_S(f,[a,b])\\leftrightarrow a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a\\leq b\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,[a,b],\\mathbb R)\\land \\exists M\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in[a,b]^{n+1}\\;((\\vec t(0)=a\\land \\vec t(n)=b\\land \\forall i&lt;n\\;(\\vec t(i)&lt;\\vec t(i+1)))\\to \\sum_{i&lt;n}|f(\\vec t(i+1))-f(\\vec t(i))|\\leq M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}variation\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2BoundedVariationFunction}_S(f,[a,b])\\leftrightarrow a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a\\leq b\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,[a,b],\\mathbb R)\\land \\exists M\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in[a,b]^{n+1}\\;((\\vec t(0)=a\\land \\vec t(n)=b\\land \\forall i&lt;n\\;(\\vec t(i)&lt;\\vec t(i+1)))\\to \\sum_{i&lt;n}|f(\\vec t(i+1))-f(\\vec t(i))|\\leq M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../